  answer: Stevie Nicks
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Stevie Nicks
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABLeather and Lace - 2016 Remaster\xBB,
    de 1981, y llega hasta 2014."
  - "Se mueve dentro de rock; \xABHas Anyone Ever Written Anything for You\xBB refleja
    una energ\xEDa media y un pulso cercano a 104 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABStand Back\xBB y \xABRooms on Fire\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABLeather and Lace (with Don Henley)\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABEdge of Seventeen\xBB y \xABStop Draggin'
    My Heart Around (with Tom Petty and The Heartbreakers) - 2016 Remaster\xBB."
